        "content": "yeah what is the project about",
        "timestamp": "2026-04-09T09:19:41.286712"
      },
      {
        "role": "ai",
        "content": "The Joboro.ai platform aims to revolutionize the recruitment process by providing an AI-powered solution that streamlines candidate screening, interviewing, and pipeline management. The primary goal is to automate traditional manual processes such as resume parsing, scheduling interviews, and managing candidate pipelines, thereby reducing time-to-hire significantly from weeks to 48-72 hours for a qualified shortlist. This platform promises a 10x faster hiring cycle and a 5x return on investment by replacing manual screening with AI-driven workflows, minimizing the reliance on staffing agencies and job boards.\n\nKey features include:\n- Automated resume parsing and eligibility screening\n- AI-conducted video and audio interviews with 360\u00b0 candidate evaluation\n- Customizable multi-stage screening workflows\n- Seamless ATS integrations, job board syndication, and team collaboration tools\n- Predictive analytics and bias-control mechanisms\n\nThe target users are hiring managers, HR recruiters, and candidates. The platform aims to provide a unified AI-powered recruitment experience that is accessible across various domains, ensuring fair, transparent, and efficient screening processes.",
        "timestamp": "2026-04-09T09:19:41.286736"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "what is the pricing stater there , can I buy it for my mid level company for requiretnemt purpose. what is the company behind this product",
