        "content": "The document does not provide specific information about the pricing structure or whether Joboro.ai can be purchased by a mid-level company. The text mentions that the platform aims to streamline and accelerate hiring processes, but it does not specify any pricing details.\n\nRegarding the company behind Joboro.ai, the source file indicates that it is \"Joboro Inc.\" with a copyright date of 2026. However, this information alone does not provide insight into who owns or operates the company.",
